Only create a vote when the save came from the rating widget.

https://www.drupal.org/project/fivestar/issues/3152654

FivestarItem::postSave() runs on every save of the host entity. With
rated_while set to "viewing" it deletes the current user's votes and recreates
one from the field's stored rating - so editing a node, accepting a workflow
change, or any other programmatic save silently overwrites the saver's own
vote, or fabricates one for a user who never voted.

Based on the patch in comment #6, with three deliberate changes:

  - setSyncing(TRUE) is not included. It suppresses content moderation's
    forced revision and default-revision handling site-wide, which is a
    larger behavioural change than this fix needs.
  - The flag is cleared in a finally block so it cannot outlive the save if
    save() throws.
  - The two nested conditionals are combined into one for readability.

diff --git a/src/Form/FivestarForm.php b/src/Form/FivestarForm.php
--- a/src/Form/FivestarForm.php
+++ b/src/Form/FivestarForm.php
@@ -119,10 +119,20 @@
       $entity = $context['entity'];
       $fivestar_field_name = $context['field_definition']->getName();
       if ($entity->hasField($fivestar_field_name)) {
+        // Mark this save as coming from the rating widget, so the field's
+        // postSave() can tell a real vote from any other entity save.
+        $entity->fivestar_form = TRUE;
+
         // For votingapi value will be save during save rating value to
         // field storage.
         $entity->set($fivestar_field_name, $form_state->getValue('vote'));
-        $entity->save();
+
+        try {
+          $entity->save();
+        }
+        finally {
+          unset($entity->fivestar_form);
+        }
       }
     }
 
diff --git a/src/Plugin/Field/FieldType/FivestarItem.php b/src/Plugin/Field/FieldType/FivestarItem.php
--- a/src/Plugin/Field/FieldType/FivestarItem.php
+++ b/src/Plugin/Field/FieldType/FivestarItem.php
@@ -243,6 +243,16 @@
     $vote_manager = \Drupal::service('fivestar.vote_manager');
     $target_entity = $this->getTargetEntity($entity, $field_settings);
     $vote_rating = $entity->get($field_definition->getName())->rating ?: 0;
+
+    // Only create a vote when the save came from the rating widget. Any other
+    // save - an edit, a track swap, a status change - must not touch votes.
+    // NOTE: this guard only applies when rated_while is "viewing" (our
+    // setting, see field.field.node.session.field_session_votes.yml). If that
+    // is ever changed to "editing", votes come from the entity form instead
+    // and this protection is intentionally bypassed.
+    if ($field_settings['rated_while'] != 'editing' && !isset($entity->fivestar_form)) {
+      return FALSE;
+    }
 
     $owner = $this->getVoteOwner($entity, $field_settings['rated_while']);
 
